}
```
The user-provided argument is duplicated into kernel memory. This is primarily a safety measure against invalid user input, but it does not address concurrency or locking concerns.

✅ **Joining Transaction (`btrfs_join_transaction`)**:
```c
trans = btrfs_join_transaction(root);
if (IS_ERR(trans)) {
    ret = PTR_ERR(trans);
    goto out;
}
